journal book log~
Day 1: We received two new plants from the Frozen Jungles of Azilmar.
Day 2: We planted them today. One in the grand gardens and the other behind the black gate.
Day 5: The plants are already starting to grow.
Day 10: The plant behind the black gate attacked a gardener today.
Day 12: The mortician came to visit today, we found his remains behind the black gate.
Day 13: We have had to seal the gate for our own protection.
Day 14: We have sent word to the guard but no one has come to help us yet.
Day 17: We can no longer control the plant we planted in these gardens.
Day 19: We have found that our superior is missing and we can't get out.
Day 24: It is only myself left and I feel that it will not be long now.
Day 25: May the immortals forgive us for releasing this..........
~
