0 0 0 0
21 4789 0
E
letter~
   Dakkon, Something has happened of dire importance.  We need you to seal the
entrance to this place and allow none to enter by any means necessary.  The God
of Fear has turned on us.  We are doing everything in our power to seal him.  
We have sealed the Traitor High Lord Satimsa and the Queen is making sure none
disturb him.  My brother the Grand Sage Portius Mertis has vanished, and it is
believed that he is working with Elru to overthrow the kingdom.  If you come
across my brother knock him out but do not kill him.  I wish to speak to him
myself.  We have sent runners to the temples of the Gods and the great rulers
of the realm to request aid for we know we cannot handle this alone.  Pray for
their success and guard the castle so that none will come to know what has
already begun in these hallowed halls.  King Abdullah Mertis
~
